#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:5
#: 2f3818497ec141b9a07cd5c969b6ec69 5d9a241249ea47bc9986914cd5892045
#: 9e9e06721a8c46d78c36f781eff12d9e c85ed5a54ca74845b9d254b59e0dcf93
#: e7a3e4cc532b4556bf873853edad61d3
msgid "Telemetry / Serial Port Setup"
msgstr "数传/串口设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:7
#: 02b4ace0f83d42eea40c7d8f8a7b04d6 73b8391c78c940b59c078c4e88c3911d
#: 9d75f1f8816f4e3a95f99b0c6db51997 b18c69b55bd94ce49d677b9fb3dc54a3
#: cc0049ed60694c4eaa52931cb4f801c7
msgid ""
"This article shows how to configure the telemetry ports (aka serial ports) "
"on the autopilot. The instructions use the Pixhawk but they apply for most "
"autopilots."
msgstr "本文介绍如何配置飞控上的数传端口（即串口）。说明以 Pixhawk 为例，但适用于大多数飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:11
#: 0821e5e423164ecea143e433e9de22ff 4010b276bd8843e8bb4a0f0d49659054
#: a259a3138bb3487ea37a7f1f38bad611 b76acf13bf3440189688aef631bb1ce3
#: dfeb87f8d0224fd4a86e169244d3e399
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:13
#: 0c39140b27fe451a8f4082cc736a0578 9e222572600c4078b54686ac37be97b6
#: bc49160373894a4599eef159795f009b d83f9bc1a4814775bddec3eaa0d440a6
#: f64fa9b2510342bdbb47c16f3b5cc8fc
msgid ""
"On a Pixhawk there are a total of 5 serial ports.  The default use of each "
"port is:"
msgstr "Pixhawk 共有 5 个串口，每个端口的默认用途如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:15
#: 1fc30c9a62044900b482928f2fae4117 255625861dca41c591462dd3975182c0
#: 2a8dc73c92304c6a89ceede798099c10 83f28e48a05843e185c03c9a9a1ca7d8
#: c4fc15531abb49779d0c2e398fb8882a
msgid ""
"The micro USB port (aka Serial0) is used to connect to the ground station "
"using a USB cable.  This should not be connected in flight because the "
"flight code assumes that if it is receiving power through this port that it "
"is on the bench and some :ref:`failsafes <copter:failsafe-landing-page>` "
"(i.e. battery failsafe) are disabled."
msgstr ""
"Micro USB 端口（即 Serial0）用于通过 USB "
"线连接地面站。飞行中不应连接此端口，因为飞控代码会认为若通过该端口供电则处于调试台状态，某些 :ref:`失控保护 <copter:failsafe-"
"landing-page>` （如电池失控保护）会被禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:16
#: 2a52db57c44f497e8bca75eb13320339 40bbf5a802c143c6a8169a38647a8715
#: 82a8816c6b3345499b9b8248e94dd086 b4ffdc619e254ef1b37fce17ec682852
#: f75188d86ce149e98170d4cf8b83d5b9
msgid ""
"Telem1 (aka Serial1) is for MAVLink communication and supports flow control."
"  This should be used especially for high power devices (up to 1 amp) But "
"NOT the :ref:`RFD900 telemetry radio <common-rfd900>`"
msgstr ""
"Telem1（即 Serial1）用于 MAVLink 通信，支持流控。该端口尤其适合高功耗设备（最高 1A），但 **不适用于** "
":ref:`RFD900 数传电台 <common-rfd900>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:18
#: 823e0f8b640b46e3a2d49289955cb7e3 94abea81ed1c4e9bb82ed3b8f5355d66
#: c6fd929ec0534b60a2c20932c075a683 c75f200de1634068ae0b8438ce39adaa
#: fabc07e23bb54af5ae17faf18faaf7e6
msgid ""
"Many non-Pixhawk style autopilots CANNOT supply even 1 amp on their port "
"supply lines. Be sure to verify with autopilots specifications. If not "
"specified, limit current to < 200 ma."
msgstr "许多非 Pixhawk 类型的飞控无法在其端口供电线上提供 1A 电流。请务必查阅飞控规格。如未注明，将电流限制在 200mA 以下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:20
#: 2669dba0c63f4fd4911a8fef928b54f0 9458805795314342b7445c7c1384866f
#: aa846bcc66d64bc78b8923b64b14010d dd8039b8a609422e90498754c1872ff7
#: f2697e17b09e4432887f20f08ad0c14c
msgid ""
"Telem2 (aka Serial2) is for MAVLink communication and supports flow control."
msgstr "Telem2（即 Serial2）用于 MAVLink 通信，支持流控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:21
#: 32adaccec93e4536929a52bb32de660e 74e10a8ea49b496d812c81ae0feca425
#: af82104d505442088987100c21f52011 d7f598544eed43e4a2d63c2c363e4e7d
#: e03e63a4561a4c71814026867a1f7af6
msgid "GPS (aka Serial3) is for connecting a GPS"
msgstr "GPS（即 Serial3）用于连接 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:22
#: 34724890e4084acfa8412991a1092d21 515f97de3c6d443f85fe5bbab2e0ee6b
#: dc48f83383264500bbb115846b531c9c e7d86ceed75b4f0096d10114a02c4d83
#: f1278b1bf2dd4ce5beadf4fe1f6fe31b
msgid ""
"Serial 4/5 contains two serial connections on a single port.  Serial4 is "
"normally used for a :ref:`second GPS <common-gps-blending>`.  Serial5 is a "
":ref:`debug connection <dev:interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh>`."
msgstr ""
"Serial 4/5 在单个端口上包含两个串口连接。Serial4 通常用于 :ref:`第二个 GPS <common-gps-"
"blending>`。Serial5 是 :ref:`调试连接 <dev:interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-"
"nsh>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:28
#: 0c5946e8356c4ef5b78f62411c01cfa4 6063289f2a834298bd67a11bcfe00eb8
#: 7f2eebee464f41e0a6bda9b09fff3e1c 81cd89b086ea4982866b1e9949124b70
#: b4a006d46cc5463baaa22b922115bdb1
msgid ""
"More details of the exact pins on each port can be found :ref:`here <common-"
"pixhawk-overview>`."
msgstr "每个端口的引脚详情可在 :ref:`此处 <common-pixhawk-overview>` 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:31
#: 0b0f7ced95a147198527bf7794ee144b 0ee7b7763c9d46b593e8678b86d56b84
#: 14308e7acec24387a0e7ed6a12cb139f c47f22839abb46d49b7c10dce359a742
#: d90b95910fad418abccbba64d569494f
msgid "Set-up through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站进行设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:33
#: 15780e45ec184354be0968d4d2f1befe 186fccdf2aac42b191a61bcf1108680f
#: 5f5f970bb61b47dc858b77c9255d2c5e 937d592f35f44e59ad30195d7ebd97b5
#: f1a604a11a1e4cb2b6bd114476704aa6
msgid ""
"The telemetry ports can be configured through the ground station by setting "
"the parameters listed below.  If you are using the *Mission Planner* open "
"the **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter List** page."
msgstr ""
"可以通过地面站设置以下参数来配置数传端口。如果使用 *Mission Planner*，请打开 **Config/Tuning \\| Full "
"Parameter List** 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:35
#: 3ca3b1cda690442ba8d78b54b7d56a54 41867e0a3bdc49af85be866e69334ca8
#: 9b35349a63364b2d82adfbddbd3f9bab ca955c22042145c4a1d28caefe18aa85
#: ddb8cb4eadb849c9a46b5b8af0a83e6b
msgid ""
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameters (where \"x\" is a number from 0 to 4, i.e. "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`) control the protocol or purpose "
"of the serial port.  You will see on wiki pages including the "
":ref:`Lightware Lidar page <common-lightware-sf10-lidar>` instructions for "
"choosing the appropriate protocol."
msgstr ""
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 参数（其中 「x」 是 0 到 4 的数字，即 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>`）控制串口的协议或用途。您会在 wiki 页面（包括 :ref:`Lightware Lidar 页面 "
"<common-lightware-sf10-lidar>`）上看到选择合适协议的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:36
#: 19465a764ffb4edf838f1f6d12979ab4 2ddefa39e540447e8e33912cdc7775cd
#: 6c45fdd872b64642be72c55dd78f79d9 8a469bbf4ff04772b1342381643b4b9c
#: b2d574966e694548a096fb5fd43ec69e
msgid ""
"``SERIALx_BAUD`` (i.e. :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>`) sets the baud "
"rate or speed of the serial port."
msgstr "``SERIALx_BAUD`` （即 :ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>`）设置串口的波特率或速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:37
#: 1f81c5211f254736938a1ea58227659f be446c82c4fa463dbc2b4391b1f439c4
#: e294021a161a471cac632e764b573501 ed2ef3d07a2d4dfa95e2e3c817c666a4
#: f6f77d7e9afe45c3946a4eb824b4ac6c
msgid ""
":ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` and :ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS "
"<BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` parameters allow enabling or disabling flow control on "
"Telem1 and Telem2."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` 和 :ref:`BRD_SER2_RTSCTS "
"<BRD_SER2_RTSCTS>` 参数允许在 Telem1 和 Telem2 上启用或禁用流控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:43
#: 19254cabafcf415cb5c7521a78e80a22 317a2840357348198d2da294832b9672
#: 9d31aacee34b4a29bcf60f7f02413624 ae41a724a98e434ebbdfa30449b4e47d
#: f2e85edc5e24479d855d1780673b4d0d
msgid "MAVLink1, MAVLink2 and Stream Rates"
msgstr "MAVLink1、MAVLink2 与流速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:45
#: 16e107f209e643cf804a2a6287f0fe16 2733316ce25d4b8dbbe44558ee640a0e
#: 2f2d3ec6487a4259a4d51a099f871364 5d2fa0b153f0444d8ed14779950374b0
#: 705960f1fce944ff88d13e561197c554
msgid ""
"For telemetry ports used for MAVLink communication you may select to use "
"MAVLink1 by setting the ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` to \"1\" or MAVLink2 by setting"
" ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` to \"2\"."
msgstr ""
"对用于 MAVLink 通信的数传端口，可把 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 设为 \"1\" 选用 MAVLink1，或把 "
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 设为 \"2\" 选用 MAVLink2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:47
#: 127e468ddc404f11876a29bb164d980b 8acbf997ac9647ceb4511d6179076ca8
#: ad65fbaa6e5f46ada021a0c58f1ee102 d7678cb30e5a483db63b145fc036d243
#: f256e6ea5ed44439946876dec516619d
msgid ""
"MAVLink2 supports \"signing\" of packets which improves security and "
"flexible length messages so it should be used when possible but some older "
"telemetry radios do not understand MAVLink2 so the default is MAVLink1."
msgstr ""
"MAVLink2 支持数据包「签名」，提高了安全性，并支持可变长度消息，因此应尽可能使用，但部分较旧的数传电台不支持 MAVLink2，因此默认使用 "
"MAVLink1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:49
#: 02cc605c8fa14e07a74fe43133f212e8 30acb08463734d029a8d9219f27f477b
#: 39c254df02d74536ab798ef954020cb4 73eceb427ee04075982f2875b1815741
#: ea7a6df823d64275a12f3d2a6c56dad9
msgid ""
"MAVLink2 is required to upload and download complex fences from the Ground "
"Control Station."
msgstr "从地面站上传和下载复杂围栏需要 MAVLink2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:51
#: 2234abc038bf40ac9944ffc616d00b6b 331187d83358427984af4ce6f396e4ff
#: 575fd89494244720809afab12cc9424e 74963b5ed5c342f7a8c70b0337452aac
#: b4206f88b78c49f29c0da3a0aaaf5b33
msgid ""
"As mentioned on the :ref:`Telemetry Logs page <planner:mission-planner-"
"telemetry-logs>` the rate messages are sent from the vehicle can be "
"controlled using the ``SRx_*`` parameters (i.e. :ref:`MAV2_POSITION "
"<MAV2_POSITION>`)."
msgstr ""
"如 :ref:`数传日志页面 <planner:mission-planner-telemetry-logs>` 所述，飞行器发送消息的速率可通过 "
"``SRx_*`` 参数（即 :ref:`MAV2_POSITION <MAV2_POSITION>`）控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:53
#: 036d0c09fb9f42398c4815f0a33fd18d 8a5b4ea6c1fe4e06a9a898f69355e40a
#: a56464856b5841c4945982f913a98d74 c8a6c1474dd14f6ea01d35bb9ede9ace
#: e18875ae7fe64f3cae71bf75289844bb
msgid ""
"SRx parameters do not directly correlate to the SERIALx port, but rather to "
"the order of the ports which have MAVLink protocol active."
msgstr "SRx 参数与 SERIALx 端口不直接对应，而是对应于已激活 MAVLink 协议的端口顺序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:55
#: 68cbd0004c9e4582b608d500e06c1035 9fd176c6c6684b2e82b2294ec5ebd290
#: a4641096592c4e43830c6a496d630324 de7789b979dd41a6944c1f647889a83c
#: fef75dd8c25f4304b83a1f0048f4c7bd
msgid ""
"The Mission Planner's **Config/Tuning |Planner** screen's **Telemetry "
"Rates** drop-downs allow a convenient way to set these parameters."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 的 **Config/Tuning | Planner** 界面中的 **Telemetry Rates** "
"下拉菜单提供了设置这些参数的便捷方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:60
#: 0b0f475e654e44d5ba84d71ffae493fa 2585cc68a6cf43a4afb3e40aad984680
#: 25de30283b1c45258c3252b4476c8a80 886560f9952242b395580b28efaffdf8
#: ac00039e3b18407cbd2cf76628d7eba8
msgid ""
"Due to CPU or bandwidth limitations, the actual rate of the data sent may be"
" lower than the rate requested."
msgstr "由于 CPU 或带宽限制，实际发送数据的速率可能低于请求的速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:62
#: 53107e00b6df445eae7943d9b8bd36ad
msgid ""
"Some telemetry systems require specific rates. In order to allow those to be"
" set in the autopilot parameters and not overriden by the GCS, set the rates"
" to \"-1\" for MP, or use the disable option in QGC. However, do not set "
"these before doing the basic autopilot radio calibration in Mission Planner "
"as it forces new values during the calibration and will not restore them "
"after it is finished."
msgstr ""
"某些数传系统要求特定速率。为了允许在飞控参数中设置这些速率而不被地面站覆盖，在 MP 中将速率设为 「-1」，或在 QGC 中使用禁用选项。但请勿在 "
"Mission Planner 中进行基本飞控电台校准之前执行此操作，因为校准过程中会强制写入新值，且完成后不会恢复。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:66
#: 447bb8d5793744f08ef48caf6257a329 8d95b7ca4e2a4369aefec49eec7e1faa
#: a2cb4d7e4a3e4e79bb685d2d103d60ea cb83f8a16e2744a2aa569d409a17eca8
#: ce19555d498d48339a53db2bcc70dbbf
msgid ""
"Most ground stations set the desired stream rate by sending the "
"`REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ MAVLink "
"message to the vehicle instead of directly setting the parameters mentioned "
"above.  If done this way, Copter **DOES NOT** save the rate changes to "
"eeprom meaning they will not persist over a reboot."
msgstr ""
"大多数地面站通过向飞行器发送 `REQUEST_DATA_STREAM "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#REQUEST_DATA_STREAM>`__ MAVLink "
"消息来设置所需流速率，而不是直接设置上述参数。若以此方式设置，Copter **不会** 将速率变更保存到 EEPROM，这意味着重启后不会保留。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:68
#: 4be10de1385d4330b96f6e9b24836f9a 4c496f29c93440f296d808769b9440fb
#: 622c071a617648fda790f1de910fa6ec d21e8d3aaab14745b9ac3f4d0de1416b
#: e69e1d973af2422cae1e059d59c75f94
msgid ""
"In practice users may notice that if the vehicle is rebooted but the "
"telemetry connection is not disconnected and reconnected that the data from "
"the vehicle may be much slower or missing.  I.e. the vehicle's position on "
"the map may not update.  Normally disconnecting/reconnecting with the ground"
" station will resolve this."
msgstr ""
"实际使用中，用户可能会注意到，如果飞行器重启但数传连接未断开并重新连接，飞行器数据可能明显减少或缺失，例如地图上飞行器位置可能不更新。通常，断开并重新连接地面站可以解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:70
#: 515e1c4d15bf40a990bc8bdb30337ede 8df7b64f675c42e987681843c1e79c70
#: 97715125a04541e98432f3dbd3a02412 b2cfbee9562a427585b34df6e0938a23
#: dfbecb3335a24c13b0f87de16d5436d6
msgid ""
"See also :ref:`Requesting Data From The Autopilot <dev:mavlink-requesting-"
"data>`"
msgstr "另请参阅 :ref:`从飞控请求数据 <dev:mavlink-requesting-data>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-port-setup.rst:62
#: 56c729649be34916822e6bff74aa1ce1 73a2121ed02446f8aa759859bcf46144
#: 794b83d019a0419191cd1668d497e9b7 d5bce301ebc44c65ba35f6df48eed684
msgid ""
"Some telemetry systems require specific rates. In order to allow those to be"
" set in the autopilot parameters and not overridden by the GCS, set the "
"rates to \"-1\" for MP, or use the disable option in QGC. However, do not "
"set these before doing the basic autopilot radio calibration in Mission "
"Planner as it forces new values during the calibration and will not restore "
"them after it is finished."
msgstr ""
"某些数传系统需要特定的速率。为了让这些速率能在飞控参数中设置且不被地面站覆盖，在 MP 中将速率设为 \"-1\"，或在 QGC "
"中使用禁用选项。但是，在 Mission Planner "
"中完成基本的飞控遥控校准之前不要设置这些参数，因为校准过程会强制写入新值，且完成后不会恢复原值。"
